comment1.text=\r\n\ The\ constructor\ for\ LoadBalancer\ objects\ initialises\r\n\ two\ fields.\ One\ is\ for\ the\ object's\ name,\ passed\r\n\ as\ an\ argument\ and\ another\ for\ an\ empty\ TreeMap\ \r\n\ that\ later\ will\ hold\ Virtual\r\n\ Machine\ objects.\r\n
